  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.0: NEW - Batch streaming API for parallel multi-algorithm hashing! CreateAllStreaming() and CreateBatchStreaming() enable processing 70 algorithms simultaneously with 8-16x speedup on multi-core systems. IMultiStreamingHashBytes interface with parallel processing strategy. 762 tests passing (10 new batch API tests). Fixes #17.",
